+ * is disabled" (RP2040 i2c.h:1908-1910 vs :1929-1931, quoted in
+ * work/evidence-abrt-sources.md). tar/con print the FULL registers
+ * so the verify sees TAR[12] (10-bit mode) and CON[15:8] too.
+ * tar/con are the ENGINE's
